\trowd\trgaph108\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\cellx3120\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\cellx6240\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\cellx9360{\pard\intbl\sa0 {\f1 attribution.py}\cell}{\pard\intbl\sa0 J2\cell}{\pard\intbl\sa0 Who changed each file between two rounds, author or AI, read from the AI-use record and the generator stamp, with the basis named: the published generator, AI as declared, not declared this round, or the author. Lists the AI-use entries each round declares, reads a first submission against nothing (who made each file), and flags an AI-use entry that appears for the first time dated before the previous submission. It reads the declarations; it cannot verify them.\cell}\row
