\trowd\trgaph108\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\cellx3120\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\cellx6240\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\cellx9360{\pard\intbl\sa0 {\f1 corpus.py}, {\f1 retrieval.py}\cell}{\pard\intbl\sa0 \cell}{\pard\intbl\sa0 The corpus: the venues in {\f1 1-journal/corpus/venues.yaml} searched through OpenAlex (keyword queries from the claim and the title, then the works most cited among the hits), and the hand list; sources and enrichment cached, and each run keeps its candidates, so runs resume and replay offline.\cell}\row
